    "created_at": "2023-10-10T11:35:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-10T11:35:49Z",
    "body": "As noted, the structural aspects of the table are already conveyed (number of columns and rows) and authors do not need to state that information.\r\n\r\nSince a summary would (or should) be tailored to the audience as much as the data, creation is rightly left to authors. All H73 does is tell authors which attribute to use (for HTML4 and XHTML) for that summary, not that the browser creates the summary.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
